\ls1\ilvl0\cf0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9642 	}1. In this NYC Citibike Analysis, I've created a map of where all the citibikes of the start location is located with exact latitude and longitudes. A lot of bikes are used in the central area of the city. The most bikes are borrowed in Central Park S & 6th Ave station. At the end of the trip, people return bikes across the whole city, there were no specific location that people prefer to return their bikes.\
