\ls2\ilvl0\cf0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9642 	}2. People of all ages use citibikes, but the majority age group is around 28-40 years old. A     lot of 40 years old use bikes at the start station, probably because that age group prefers to get their exercise in rather than taking other public transport station.\
